{"name":"Bespoke","hex":"#d4ba9d","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"bespoke","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Made or done in a way adjusted to the needs of a specific person or group (e.g., customer, health care patient, do-it-yourselfer), and thus specialized and, in some cases, unique.","Relating to someone who makes custom-made products, especially clothing items."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["simple past of bespeak","past participle of bespeak"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/bespoke"}],"entries":[{"title":"Bespoke","blocks":[{"text":"Bespoke describes any item commissioned to a particular specification, altered or tailored to the customs, tastes, or usage of an individual purchaser. In contemporary usage, \"bespoke\" has become a general marketing and branding concept implying exclusivity and limited runs."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5b/Bespoke_chalkstripe_suit_sven_krolczik.jpg/330px-Bespoke_chalkstripe_suit_sven_krolczik.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bespoke"},{"title":"Bespoke (album)","blocks":[{"text":"Bespoke is a studio album by American electronic music producer Daedelus. It was released on Ninja Tune in 2011."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/2/25/Bespoke_Front_Cover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bespoke_(album)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/97/Shoe_lasts_of_Queen_Victoria_from_1898_at_John_Lobb%2C_bespoke_shoe_and_bootmaker%2C_88_Jermyn_Street%2C_London.jpg/500px-Shoe_lasts_of_Queen_Victoria_from_1898_at_John_Lobb%2C_bespoke_shoe_and_bootmaker%2C_88_Jermyn_Street%2C_London.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/97/Shoe_lasts_of_Queen_Victoria_from_1898_at_John_Lobb%2C_bespoke_shoe_and_bootmaker%2C_88_Jermyn_Street%2C_London.jpg/500px-Shoe_lasts_of_Queen_Victoria_from_1898_at_John_Lobb%2C_bespoke_shoe_and_bootmaker%2C_88_Jermyn_Street%2C_London.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The bespoke shoe lasts of Queen Victoria from 1898 and Earl Mountbatten of Burma at John Lobb Bootmaker in London","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AShoe_lasts_of_Queen_Victoria_from_1898_at_John_Lobb%2C_bespoke_shoe_and_bootmaker%2C_88_Jermyn_Street%2C_London.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f8/TailoringFirstFitFront01.jpg/500px-TailoringFirstFitFront01.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f8/TailoringFirstFitFront01.jpg/500px-TailoringFirstFitFront01.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Fitting of a bespoke jacket","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ATailoringFirstFitFront01.jpg"}],"sounds":{"bespoke":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c9/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-%D8%B9%D9%8F%D8%AB%D9%85%D8%A7%D9%86_%28Middle_river_exports%29-bespoke.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c9/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-%D8%B9%D9%8F%D8%AB%D9%85%D8%A7%D9%86_%28Middle_river_exports%29-bespoke.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-%D8%B9%D9%8F%D8%AB%D9%85%D8%A7%D9%86_%28Middle_river_exports%29-bespoke.wav.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c9/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-%D8%B9%D9%8F%D8%AB%D9%85%D8%A7%D9%86_%28Middle_river_exports%29-bespoke.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-%D8%B9%D9%8F%D8%AB%D9%85%D8%A7%D9%86_%28Middle_river_exports%29-bespoke.wav.ogg"},{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upl